{"id":"b639865968a11516","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-preimage-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Preimage Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-preimage-closed-class — ZFC Preimage Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-preimage-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-preimage-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-preimage-closed-class — ZFC Preimage Closed Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-map-preimage]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-preimage-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-preimage-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-preimage-closed-class — ZFC Preimage Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ff9b8482d2bc3a99\" href=\"?note=ff9b8482d2bc3a99\" title=\"58-df-zfc-map-preimage\">58-df-zfc-map-preimage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C(x)\">\\(\\mathcal C(x)\\)</span> (metalinguistic class formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,f,a,P\\in V\">\\(X,Y,f,a,P\\in V\\)</span> (sets quantified in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreimageClosedClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PreimageClosedClass}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}preimage\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PreimageClosedClass}_S[\\mathcal C]\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X,Y,f,a,P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C(X)\\land\\mathcal C(Y)\\land\\mathcal C(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land a\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S(P,f,a)\n\\to\\mathcal C(P)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}preimage\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PreimageClosedClass}_S[\\mathcal C]\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X,Y,f,a,P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C(X)\\land\\mathcal C(Y)\\land\\mathcal C(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land a\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S(P,f,a)\n\\to\\mathcal C(P)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The brackets and metatheoretic turnstile mark class-formula indexing, so no set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq V\">\\(C\\subseteq V\\)</span> is falsely postulated; every preimage is a set witnessed by the registered predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-map-preimage","status":"resolved","id":"ff9b8482d2bc3a99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-map-preimage]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C(x)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,f,a,P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PreimageClosedClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}preimage\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PreimageClosedClass}_S[\\mathcal C]\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall X,Y,f,a,P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C(X)\\land\\mathcal C(Y)\\land\\mathcal C(a)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land a\\subseteq Y\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S(P,f,a)\n\\to\\mathcal C(P)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"C\\subseteq V","display":false}],"bytes":1169,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-preimage-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-preimage-closed-class]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ff9b8482d2bc3a99","36d7463d215be751"]}